Output docs/img/ui.gif
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Source docs/demo/common.tape

Type "dockup ui"
Enter
# bubbletea queries the terminal first; keys sent too early get lost
Sleep 2s
Down@400ms 4
Sleep 600ms
Type "a"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "x"
Sleep 800ms
Down@300ms 3
Type " "
Sleep 1.2s
Tab
Sleep 2s
Type "v"
Sleep 2s
Type "v"
Sleep 800ms
Type "/"
Sleep 400ms
Type@150ms "3000,8443,9000"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Tab
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
